"A mishnen is a dog-sized, smooth-skinned crocodile-like beast with four tentacles for a tail."
"It is mottled brown, swims very fast, hides under sand and cannot come onto land."
"It eats only a few times in its life, locks onto quality prey and digests fast."
"It repels spell attacks but is very susceptible to poison; it is not intelligent."
"When it dies a light-show organ throws violet lightning."
"Endangered, it is on the restricted summons list; legal summons take years of waiting."
"Its parts are valuable."
